   "text": "DeepSeek V3.2 (open weights)\nServed by Phala Network inside NVIDIA GPU TEEs\n  with Intel TDX hosts, routed via OpenRouter\nDirect Phala path: TDX quote verified with\n  @phala/aci-verifier + signed receipt per reply\nLocal dev: Ollama running Qwen 2.5 7B",
   "originalText": "DeepSeek V3.2 (open weights)\nServed by Phala Network inside NVIDIA GPU TEEs\n  with Intel TDX hosts, routed via OpenRouter\nDirect Phala path: TDX quote verified with\n  @phala/aci-verifier + signed receipt per reply\nLocal dev: Ollama running Qwen 2.5 7B",
