   "text": "Cairo 2.14 contract: ArticleRegistry\n  full article in 31-byte chunks, digest-bound\n  0x2be142c3...fe4f6f0 on Sepolia\nScarb + Starknet Foundry (snforge) for tests\nExplorer links: Voyager, Starkscan",
