   "text": "STRK20 privacy pool v2.1 (Sepolia)\nPrivacy SDK 0.14.3-rc.8 (server side)\nWallet API strk20InvokeTransaction (browser)\n1 STRK private bond to treasury 0x0685...fbd0,\n  refunded privately (waiting on prover fix)\ntip_inbox helper contract (drafted, not live)",
